{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-006",
    "title": "半枚残印"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_031",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "他们离开废井时，山门方向忽然亮起一排火把。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有重复自己的问题。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 623,
          "end": 623
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯熄灭后，木栅栏后的黑暗像一块浸水的布，贴在山道尽头。巡夜铜铃已经停了，只有远处值房传来几声压低的争吵。有人在问是谁越过封闭线，也有人急着解释灯火熄灭只是油路出了问题。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 625,
          "end": 625
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把布袋里的灯芯和铜环取出来，放在掌心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 627,
          "end": 627
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离先看灯芯，再看铜环。她的眉头微不可察地皱了一下，伸手却没有碰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 629,
          "end": 629
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“铜环从哪里来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 631,
          "end": 631
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“杂木林。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 633,
          "end": 633
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁给你的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 635,
          "end": 635
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它自己滚过来的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 637,
          "end": 637
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有笑：“这不是答案。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 639,
          "end": 639
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只看见它从泥里滚出一寸。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 641,
          "end": 641
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她蹲下，用一根枯枝拨开铜环上的泥。横纹之间嵌着黑色细屑，与第三章账单缺口中的印泥相同。她把枯枝折成两段，将铜环挑进一张纸里包好。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 643,
          "end": 643
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先别交给沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 645,
          "end": 645
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不信她？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 647,
          "end": 647
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不信任何一个能把旧账裁掉的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 649,
          "end": 649
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向木栅栏上的封条：“你知道废井在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 651,
          "end": 651
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 653,
          "end": 653
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你去过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 655,
          "end": 655
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只在账上见过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 657,
          "end": 657
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离从袖中取出那张被火燎过的账单。她把纸摊在膝上，指尖压住“顾氏”二字，随后沿着下方残缺的墨线慢慢读：“第三盏灯，送入西坡旧井。经手人，顾氏旁支……日期被烧掉了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 659,
          "end": 659
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这和陆沉舟有什么关系？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 661,
          "end": 661
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你父亲的名字也在旁边。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 663,
          "end": 663
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临的手指收紧。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 665,
          "end": 665
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "账单最右侧只剩半个“陆”字。纸角被火燎得卷曲，无法判断后面的字究竟是沉、舟，还是别的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 667,
          "end": 667
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“走吧。”顾长离站起来，“趁天亮之前，去看一眼。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 669,
          "end": 669
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们没有走山道，而是绕过药圃，沿一条被藤蔓遮住的小路下行。路边立着几块倒塌的石碑，碑文大都磨平，只剩“灯”“井”两个字偶尔从苔痕间露出来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 671,
          "end": 671
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "废井在杂木林尽头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 673,
          "end": 673
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一块青黑色石板盖住井口。井沿没有青苔，像是最近才有人擦过。石板边缘留着一道新鲜的拖痕，拖痕里混着灰白石屑。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 675,
          "end": 675
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离蹲下看了很久：“这里有人来过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 677,
          "end": 677
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“昨夜？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 679,
          "end": 679
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“或者更早。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 681,
          "end": 681
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "井下传来一声轻响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 683,
          "end": 683
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是水滴。更像有人在黑暗里敲了一下灯罩。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 685,
          "end": 685
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临的掌心立刻发冷。他按住胸口，呼吸变得不稳。顾长离将一枚铜针夹在指间，目光停在石板缝隙。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 687,
          "end": 687
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你听见了吗？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 689,
          "end": 689
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“听见了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 691,
          "end": 691
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“像什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 693,
          "end": 693
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“像有人不愿意让我们下去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 695,
          "end": 695
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "井下又响了一下，比刚才更远。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 697,
          "end": 697
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临伸手去推石板。石板纹丝不动，边缘却落下薄薄一层灰。那灰没有散开，沿着他的手背排成一条弯线，形状和木牌背面的圆纹相似。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 699,
          "end": 699
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离一把扣住他的手腕：“别碰。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 701,
          "end": 701
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你说过，有些账不能只看眼前的数。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 703,
          "end": 703
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这不是账。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 705,
          "end": 705
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 707,
          "end": 707
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她没有回答。她用铜针挑起石板边缘的泥，露出一枚嵌在井沿下方的旧铜钉。铜钉顶端有一道缺口，和铜环的断面严丝合缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 709,
          "end": 709
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人把铜环从这里取走过。”顾长离说，“后来又把它带进了林子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 711,
          "end": 711
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 713,
          "end": 713
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 715,
          "end": 715
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是她第一次明确说不知道。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 717,
          "end": 717
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向石板。井下的敲击声停了，寂静反而比声音更重。若他们现在打开石板，便可能找到陆沉舟留下的东西；若惊动了井中的某种存在，连退路都未必保得住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 719,
          "end": 719
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我们可以回去找沈砚秋。”顾长离说，“她有权限，也有药。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 721,
          "end": 721
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她会封住这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 723,
          "end": 723
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封住不等于毁掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 725,
          "end": 725
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看见什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-085",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 969,
          "end": 969
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一条山道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-086",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 971,
          "end": 971
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-087",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 973,
          "end": 973
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向掌心。那道残印没有带来力量，气海仍只有微弱的一缕灵气。可他忽然想不起北河城家门口那棵老槐树的样子。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-088",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 975,
          "end": 975
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他知道那里有一棵树，却想不起树冠朝哪边伸展。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-089",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 977,
          "end": 977
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我忘了一件小事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-090",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 979,
          "end": 979
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的脸色变了：“什么小事？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-091",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 981,
          "end": 981
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“暂时还不重要。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-092",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 983,
          "end": 983
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "井底传来一声敲击。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-093",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 985,
          "end": 985
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这一次，石板下响起了第二声回应。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-094",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 987,
          "end": 987
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抓住他的手腕：“走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-095",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 989,
          "end": 989
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们离开废井时，山门方向忽然亮起一排火把。戒律堂的人正在搜山，火光沿着石阶向西坡逼近。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-096",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 991,
          "end": 991
        }
      }
    ],
